#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:21
#: 25bfc64af3994e76b39ba84445f5662b
msgid ""
"**ARX Lift 2S** is the full-body ARX (方舟无限) mobile manipulator (including"
" chassis). **Acone** / **AC One** is **dual-arm**, not Lift 2S. "
"**HighTorque Panthera HT** (高擎) is a dual-arm manipulator. Prefer the "
"dedicated how-to pages. You don't need internal access for those `open-"
"deploy-ws` branches."
msgstr ""
"**方舟无限 Lift 2S** 是全身移动操作臂（含底盘）。**Acone** / **AC One** 是 **双臂**，不是 Lift "
"2S。**高擎 Panthera HT** 是双臂操作臂。请优先看对应操作指南。使用这些 `open-deploy-ws` 分支不需要内部权限。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:24
#: 9e23c9037cf04f39b3ac1b8d12fc4271
