#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:149
#: 2241d38be2774d10a241623277a5ea7f
msgid "Day 5: Teleoperation"
msgstr "第 5 天: 遥操作"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:151
#: b0cd06417f9c417e99eb54cad0d44332
msgid "**Goal:** Control the robot via VR or isomorphic teleop."
msgstr "**目标：** 通过 VR 或同构遥操作控制机器人。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:153
#: ccd524c0f09441bf819747dbc09f1bc2
msgid "VR Teleoperation"
msgstr "VR 遥操作"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:155
#: 35055bdad4644c1e8e3975a98c0df27c
msgid ""
"**Supported headsets:** Pico Enterprise (recommended; USB 网络共享, "
"Enterprise App), Pico consumer (different App), and Meta Quest. Backends:"
" WebXR (`./run.sh vr`) or XRoboToolkit (`./run.sh vr-xrt`)."
msgstr ""
"**支持的头显：** Pico 企业版（推荐；USB 网络共享、企业版 App）、Pico 消费版（不同 App）和 Meta "
"Quest。后端：WebXR（`./run.sh vr`）或 XRoboToolkit（`./run.sh vr-xrt`）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:157
#: 89679522421149829dc78913c75338b9
msgid ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr\n"
msgstr ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:162
#: 71bd9fc90c6e4cfeb164c398f525d6f1
msgid "Pico Enterprise vs consumer"
msgstr "Pico 企业版与消费版"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:165
#: 1c8091424ad54555accf93aad75121d6
msgid ""
"Pico **Enterprise** and Pico **consumer** are different SKUs: Enterprise "
"supports USB 网络共享 and uses a **different App**. Install the App that "
"matches the headset edition."
msgstr ""
"Pico **企业版** 与 Pico **消费版** 是不同 SKU：企业版支持 USB 网络共享，并使用**不同的 "
"App**。不要为两者安装同一个 App。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:168
#: 05a4638b689840d8a5099e70eb496bec
msgid "Isomorphic Teleop (HighTorque Panthera HT)"
msgstr "同构遥操作（高擎 Panthera HT）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:170
#: 8f442be89f014da69297c22c27942b61
msgid ""
"Master–slave **isomorphic teleop** (同构遥操作). On the `panthera-ht` branch, "
"real-robot teleop is `./teleop_start.sh` — see [HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md). Mock "
"(package README):"
msgstr ""
"主从 **同构遥操作**。在 `panthera-ht` 分支上，真机遥操作是 `./teleop_start.sh` — 见 [高擎 "
"Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)。模拟（软件包 "
"README）："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:172
#: cf44b06c7c7346b4b7d5334a6b197885
msgid ""
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:179
#: 78318f9a08b64165b236ee3fdd523359
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** VR pose publisher, "
"[drag_teleop_controller](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller)"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** VR 位姿发布器、[drag_teleop_controller](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller)"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:181
#: c43aaa45e6d342888f3bb4187b9e5b16
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** Real-time control via VR headset or master–slave isomorphic "
"teleop."
msgstr "**预期结果：** 通过 VR 头显或主从同构遥操作进行实时控制。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:183
#: e0b3f6ce0c7d45089a3f4b22ea7acad5
msgid "Day 6: Real Hardware"
msgstr "第 6 天：真实硬件"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:185
#: 784e76c1070c421cb82bdf1ea2910b8e
msgid "**Goal:** Deploy to physical robots."
msgstr "**目标：** 部署到实体机器人。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:187
#: 168acc4bc0344a4b85bd408a865808e6
msgid "Public Path (ARX Lift 2S, Acone, HighTorque Panthera HT)"
msgstr "公开路径（方舟无限 Lift 2S、Acone、高擎 Panthera HT）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:189
#: 540a3b141c64406f9e96631239feae1f
msgid ""
"Use the matching **branch README** and `./quick_start.sh`. **Acone** / "
"**AC One** is **dual-arm**; **Lift 2S** is the full-body platform."
msgstr ""
"使用对应 **分支 README** 和 `./quick_start.sh`。**Acone** / **AC One** 是 "
"**双臂**；**Lift 2S** 是全身平台。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:191
#: d0688c8ea20f40b2a0443ebd4663052b
msgid ""
"**[ARX Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md)** — "
"full-body including chassis: `git clone -b arx-lift2s …` then "
"`./init_repo.sh` / `./quick_start.sh`"
msgstr ""
"**[方舟无限 Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md)** — "
"全身含底盘：`git clone -b arx-lift2s …` 然后 `./init_repo.sh` / "
"`./quick_start.sh`"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:192
#: 38f958b4c9d84baa8a72960632300845
msgid ""
"**Acone** / **AC One** — **dual-arm**; same `arx-lift2s` workspace, pick "
"ACone in `quick_start` for co-debug"
msgstr ""
"**Acone** / **AC One** — **双臂**；同一 `arx-lift2s` 工作空间，在 `quick_start` 中选 "
"ACone 做联调"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:193
#: 1b6dba3d4aeb4db48db9825c9012f032
msgid ""
"**[HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)** — "
"dual-arm: `git clone -b panthera-ht …` then `./init_repo.sh` / "
"`./quick_start.sh`"
msgstr ""
"**[高擎 Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)** — "
"双臂：`git clone -b panthera-ht …` 然后 `./init_repo.sh` / `./quick_start.sh`"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:195
#: 53b1c0916d494b5085dab2e7b6e878ad
msgid "Internal Path (FA Robots)"
msgstr "内部路径（FA 机器人）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:197
#: a701a51180df44eb8ebe5df6162575ad
msgid "Internal Access Required"
msgstr "需要内部访问权限"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:200
#: 2c2cb6f12dad44c5bee7c0ba67897e37
msgid ""
"FA robots (W2, W2R, S2, S2R, dual-arm CCS) require access to `fa-deploy-"
"ws`. Contact your team lead for repository access and hardware "
"allocation."
msgstr "FA 机器人（W2、W2R、S2、S2R、双臂 CCS）需要访问 `fa-deploy-ws`。请联系团队负责人申请仓库权限并分配硬件。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:204
#: e2bb980eff1240619467249ad2ef22af
msgid ""
"Clone `fa-deploy-ws` and run the init / quick-start scripts named in "
"**that repository’s README** (not public). Flags and robot IDs are "
"documented only there."
msgstr ""
"克隆 `fa-deploy-ws`，并运行**该仓库 README**（非公开）中写明的 init / quick-start 脚本。参数和机器人"
" ID 只写在那里。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:205
#: 16dbb4af684644b2b1f75c3cd7e965d3
msgid "Follow [fa-deploy-ws Setup](../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)."
msgstr "见 [fa-deploy-ws 配置](../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:207
#: 6060465d836d4231bd1bb7d672a04214
msgid ""
"**Safety:** Verify in `mock_components` (or that workspace’s documented "
"sim path) before `hardware:=real`."
msgstr "**安全：** 先在 `mock_components`（或该工作区文档中的仿真路径）验证，再使用 `hardware:=real`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:209
#: e34c92a48c85485480615d0fe08aa24c
msgid "Day 7+: Add a Robot"
msgstr "第 7 天及以后：添加机器人"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:211
#: 12f71af9e5bb44c38e71912f6699b3cf
msgid "**Goal:** Integrate a new robot into the ecosystem."
msgstr "**目标：** 将新机器人集成到生态系统中。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:214
#: c24d458883f24cc098ee1626d137b78b
msgid "Create a description package with URDF/xacro"
msgstr "用 URDF/xacro 创建描述包"

